cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "_codex_: ML Training, Evaluation, and Plugin Framework"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Aries Serpent"
    email: "aries-serpent@example.org"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aries-Serpent/_codex_"
url: "https://github.com/Aries-Serpent/_codex_"
abstract: >
  _codex_ is a comprehensive ML training, evaluation, and plugin framework 
  built with PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, Hydra, and MLflow. It provides
  LoRA/QLoRA fine-tuning, distributed training with Ray, model serving, and 
  extensive configuration management for reproducible ML experiments.
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - pytorch
  - transformers
  - lora
  - qlora
  - mlflow
  - hydra
  - training
  - evaluation
  - model-serving
  - python
